  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0240_system_01",
      "hash64": "282D15851D1DCCB9",
      "text": "¿Quieres enfrentarte a Laureano del\\nAlto Mando?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_01",
      "hash64": "5AFD14EB25E56921",
      "text": "Conque eres tú.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_02",
      "hash64": "5AFD11EB25E56408",
      "text": "Pues, como ves, soy miembro del Alto Mando\\ntambién. Uno no se salva de hacer horas extra.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_03",
      "hash64": "5AFD12EB25E565BB",
      "text": "En el gimnasio, me acompañan Pokémon\\nde tipo Normal, como yo mismo, vaya.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_04",
      "hash64": "5AFD17EB25E56E3A",
      "text": "Pero aquí me han ordenado especializarme en\\nun tipo distinto.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_05",
      "hash64": "5AFD18EB25E56FED",
      "text": "Si tienes alguna queja, te remito al departamento\\nde reclamaciones. O sea, habla con la súper.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_06",
      "hash64": "5AFD15EB25E56AD4",
      "text": "Una vez finiquitados los prolegómenos, empiezo\\nentonces mi jornada laboral propiamente dicha.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_07",
      "hash64": "5AFD16EB25E56C87",
      "text": "Te he juzgado mal. Ya veo por qué la súper te\\ntiene en alta estima.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_08",
      "hash64": "5AFD0BEB25E559D6",
      "text": "Bien... Según el orden del día, el siguiente sería\\nel último miembro del Alto Mando.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_09",
      "hash64": "5AFD0CEB25E55B89",
      "text": "Adelante, Hesperio.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_10",
      "hash64": "5B0099EB25E880F7",
      "text": "¿Hola?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0240_ground_01",
      "hash64": "7A09E7C76116B39B",
      "text": "No es por nada, pero lo mismo ni te ha oído...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_11",
      "hash64": "5B0098EB25E87F44",
      "text": "Hmm... Adelante, Hesperio.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0240_ground_02",
      "hash64": "7A09E8C76116B54E",
      "text": "Madre mía, Laureano. ¿No podrías proyectar la\\nvoz un poquitín más?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0240_fly_12",
      "hash64": "5B009BEB25E8845D",
      "text": "Hesperio...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0240_ground_03",
      "hash64": "7A09E9C76116B701",
      "text": "¡Hesperio! ¡Que te toca, hombre! ¡Sal ya![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0240_dragon_00",
      "hash64": "7823B1378167B720",
      "text": "Heme aquí. Dichosos los ojos, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
